---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for shannonsuttles.com.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 pt-16 pb-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pt-24">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-3">
        <p class="label mb-7">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-display-md leading-tight font-light text-ink-900">
          Accessibility
        </h1>

        <div class="prose-editorial mt-12">
          <p>
            This website was built so that poetry is comfortable to read for as many people as
            possible.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-light text-ink-900">What has been done</h2>
          <p>
            The site uses semantic HTML with a single logical heading order on every page, and can
            be navigated entirely by keyboard with a visible focus outline throughout. A "skip to
            content" link is the first thing a keyboard or screen-reader user reaches.
          </p>
          <p>
            All text, including small labels and gold accents, meets WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1) against its background, and focus indicators meet 3:1. Animation is subtle
            by design and switches off completely when a device requests reduced motion. If
            JavaScript fails or is disabled, all content still displays — nothing is hidden behind
            an animation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Images carry descriptive alternative text, and the content system asks for a
            description whenever an image is uploaded.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-light text-ink-900">
            Known limitations
          </h2>
          <p>
            Poetry depends on line breaks and spacing to carry meaning. Screen readers announce
            these differently than a sighted reader experiences them, and a poem's visual shape may
            not translate fully to audio.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-light text-ink-900">Tell us</h2>
          <p>
            If any part of this site is difficult to use, please write to
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="link-editorial">{SITE.email}</a>. Accessibility
            problems are treated as bugs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
